{"id":"62eac1885ebe3943","group":"58","path":"58/batch20/58-df-truth-table-reducible.md","title":"Truth-Table Reducibility","display":"df-truth-table-reducible — Truth-Table Reducibility","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-truth-table-reducible","aliases":["58-df-truth-table-reducible"],"display":"df-truth-table-reducible — Truth-Table Reducibility","depends_on":["[[58-df-recursive]]","[[58-df-function]]","[[../batch07/58-df-zfc-recursion2-truth-table-reducibility.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-truth-table-reducible"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-truth-table-reducible</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-truth-table-reducible — Truth-Table Reducibility"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"da0bcf2e3f060472\" href=\"?note=da0bcf2e3f060472\" title=\"58-df-recursive\">58-df-recursive</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"58-df-function\">58-df-function</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"e733fe56d69651f6\" href=\"?note=e733fe56d69651f6\" title=\"../batch07/58-df-zfc-recursion2-truth-table-reducibility.md\">../batch07/58-df-zfc-recursion2-truth-table-reducibility.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B\\subseteq\\omega\">\\(A,B\\subseteq\\omega\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcRecursion2TruthTableReducibility}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcRecursion2TruthTableReducibility}_S\\)</span> 为内部已定义的真值表归约谓词，含可计算查询、有效布尔表编码和求值。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\leq_{tt}\">\\(\\leq_{tt}\\)</span> 保留原二元接口。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}tt\\text{-}reducible}\\vdash\nA\\leq_{tt}B\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{ZfcRecursion2TruthTableReducibility}_S(A,B).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}tt\\text{-}reducible}\\vdash\nA\\leq_{tt}B\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{ZfcRecursion2TruthTableReducibility}_S(A,B).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>调用本书已有的同一真值表归约定义，避免重复引入未定义的自然数序列长度、取分量及集合论配对输入。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-recursive","status":"resolved","id":"da0bcf2e3f060472","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-recursive]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-function","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch07/58-df-zfc-recursion2-truth-table-reducibility.md","status":"resolved","id":"e733fe56d69651f6","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch07/58-df-zfc-recursion2-truth-table-reducibility.md]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"A,B\\subseteq\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcRecursion2TruthTableReducibility}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\leq_{tt}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}tt\\text{-}reducible}\\vdash\nA\\leq_{tt}B\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{ZfcRecursion2TruthTableReducibility}_S(A,B).","display":true}],"bytes":931,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-1327","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch20/58-df-truth-table-reducible.md|58-df-truth